---
import Page from '../layouts/page.astro';
---
<Page title="Platfolio — Put your app online">
  <div class="ui-workspace-columns">
    <section class="ui-public-intro">
      <h1>Put your app online</h1>
      <p>Launch your app from GitHub on hosting your team owns. Keep control of your code and data, and pay your hosting provider directly.</p>
      <div class="ui-workspace-links">
        <a class="ui-workspace-primary ui-hit-primary" href="/dashboard">Open workspace</a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="ui-workspace-panel" aria-label="How hosting works">
      <h2>How hosting works</h2>
      <ol class="ui-hosting-steps">
        <li><strong>Connect your code and hosting</strong><p>Choose where your code lives in GitHub and where it will run in Railway.</p></li>
        <li><strong>Review the setup before launch</strong><p>See what you’ll run and approve the setup changes in GitHub.</p></li>
        <li><strong>Check your app after launch</strong><p>See what’s running and whether it passed its checks. Pause the app when you don’t need it.</p></li>
      </ol>
    </section>
  </div>
</Page>
